"The CUAV v5 is an advanced autopilot designed and made by CUAV. The board is"
" based on the FMUv5 open hardware design, with further attribution `here "
"<https://github.com/cuav/hardware/blob/master/PixHack_v5/README.md>`__. It "
"is intended primarily for academic and commercial users."
